- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:08:08.073 --> 00:08:09.203
- Like cyborg stuff.

00:08:09.203 --> 00:08:11.130
- [Kelly] And look at you now.

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:12.455
Yes.

00:08:12.455 --> 00:08:13.288
So Chad and Keanu,

00:08:13.288 --> 00:08:14.793
this movie has an amazing action scene

00:08:14.793 --> 00:08:16.260
