00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:18.269
but (speaking french), I
don't know how you say it.

00:08:18.269 --> 00:08:19.629
Was that tough to do?

00:08:19.629 --> 00:08:20.462
It was so cool.

00:08:20.462 --> 00:08:21.323
Because I feel like

00:08:21.323 --> 00:08:23.006
when you do the fourth movie

00:08:23.006 --> 00:08:24.959
and then also like there's
a lot of action movies made.

00:08:24.959 --> 00:08:25.792
Right?

00:08:25.792 --> 00:08:26.629
I've never seen anything like that.

00:08:26.629 --> 00:08:27.854
It was so cool.

00:08:27.854 --> 00:08:29.609
It like played out.

00:08:29.609 --> 00:08:32.977
Like how, how long did
it take to plan that?

00:08:32.977 --> 00:08:34.154
Because the whole sequence is like

00:08:34.154 --> 00:08:35.498
this giant circle of gunfire.

00:08:35.498 --> 00:08:38.633
- I think Keanu, how long
were you driving for?

00:08:38.633 --> 00:08:39.466
Maybe six months out before?

00:08:39.466 --> 00:08:41.578
- No, no, I was only
driving like four or five.

00:08:41.578 --> 00:08:42.411
- Four or five months out.

00:08:42.411 --> 00:08:43.244
Sorry.

00:08:43.244 --> 00:08:44.077
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:08:44.077 --> 00:08:45.048
- He likes details.

00:08:45.048 --> 00:08:46.233
- [Chad] Yeah, about
four or five months out

00:08:46.233 --> 00:08:47.066
Keanu was driving

00:08:47.066 --> 00:08:48.276
and then the sequence we were prepping

00:08:48.276 --> 00:08:49.109
for about three months out.

00:08:49.109 --> 00:08:49.942
- [Kelly] Wow.

00:08:49.942 --> 00:08:50.775
- [Chad] But we had, I think it was like

00:08:50.775 --> 00:08:52.080
30 stunt drivers plus

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:53.401
- [Kelly] It's like choreographed.

00:08:53.401 --> 00:08:54.234
Yeah.

00:08:54.234 --> 00:08:55.758
- [Chad] Yeah. It's hard to rehearse that.

00:08:55.758 --> 00:08:56.591
So you kind of rehearse chunks

00:08:56.591 --> 00:08:58.227
and then hope it all
fits together on the day.

00:08:58.227 --> 00:09:00.385
- [Kelly] Oh my god. Poor guy.

00:09:00.385 --> 00:09:02.250
That messes the whole thing up at the end.

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:03.083
- [Chad] Yeah. That would be bad.

00:09:03.083 --> 00:09:05.086
- You know, like one guy
is like missed your mark.

00:09:05.086 --> 00:09:05.919
- How many? We had two Barracudas.

00:09:05.919 --> 00:09:07.602
We had one trophy Barracuda,

00:09:07.602 --> 00:09:09.164
that hero car that Keanu drives.

00:09:09.164 --> 00:09:10.455
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:09:10.455 --> 00:09:12.524
- [Chad] And I think we,
no, we wrecked that one too.

00:09:12.524 --> 00:09:13.357
I think we wrecked them.

00:09:13.357 --> 00:09:14.190
(Kelly laughing)

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:15.023
- [Shamier] There was,
there was a little boo boo.

00:09:15.023 --> 00:09:15.856
- [Chad] Yeah.

00:09:15.856 --> 00:09:16.689
- We destroyed that too.

00:09:16.689 --> 00:09:17.522
- Yeah.

00:09:17.522 --> 00:09:18.355
- And I had a little boo boo.

00:09:18.355 --> 00:09:19.415
- [Chad] There might have been some dents.

00:09:19.415 --> 00:09:20.248
- Yeah.

00:09:20.248 --> 00:09:21.332
- [Kelly] It was worth it.

00:09:21.332 --> 00:09:23.380
That is one of my
favorite scenes in a movie

00:09:23.380 --> 00:09:24.213
like an action film.

00:09:24.213 --> 00:09:25.389
I was like, "What? Still?

00:09:25.389 --> 00:09:27.263
And it's still happening."

00:09:27.263 --> 00:09:28.568
It was like, it just was incredible.

00:09:28.568 --> 00:09:30.220
It was in incre- it was like a dance.

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:31.053
- Yeah.

00:09:31.053 --> 00:09:32.470
- Of gunfire.

00:09:32.470 --> 00:09:33.788
It was in incredible.

00:09:33.788 --> 00:09:36.305
Good news, everybody.

